00:24:13.530 --> 00:24:20.180
Step into the Night. It's a poetic story about a little girl who journeys outside to meet

00:24:20.180 --> 00:24:30.000
the creatures of the night. As we step into the night, we meet many animals. We imagine

00:24:30.160 --> 00:24:34.550
to be a skunk, a spider, or even a bat.

00:24:35.440 --> 00:24:38.700
The pictures help you feel like you're the animals.

00:24:39.700 --> 00:24:41.700
Look at that mouse in the leaves.

00:24:42.520 --> 00:24:44.780
Look at the light of that firefly.

00:24:46.230 --> 00:24:48.390
The pictures are so beautiful.

00:24:49.160 --> 00:24:50.860
Isn't nighttime mysterious?

00:24:52.350 --> 00:24:55.220
I'm Kai, and this book helped me to imagine

00:24:55.220 --> 00:24:59.320
what it's like to be an animal and step into the night.

00:25:00.760 --> 00:25:04.760
Hi, I'm Daniel Linus and I read a book called "Sleep is for Everyone."

00:25:04.760 --> 00:25:07.680
It's packed with information you might not know.

00:25:07.680 --> 00:25:10.690
We all have our own ways of sleeping.

00:25:10.690 --> 00:25:16.130
For example, you curl up at night, but elephants sleep standing up.

00:25:16.130 --> 00:25:19.650
I guess that saves a lot of money on beds.

00:25:19.650 --> 00:25:23.620
Sleep gives your body a chance to rest.

00:25:23.620 --> 00:25:26.690
Did you know that scientists did an experiment on sleep?

00:25:26.690 --> 00:25:30.000
They stayed awake for days.

00:25:30.480 --> 00:25:34.140
They got mean, angry, and even yelled at their friends.

00:25:35.350 --> 00:25:38.550
Soon, they simply had to sit down to rest.

00:25:39.540 --> 00:25:44.720
This book tells us that every animal, including us, needs to sleep.

00:25:45.080 --> 00:25:45.840
Pleasant dreams.

00:25:49.970 --> 00:25:52.560
Well, that's it.

00:25:54.060 --> 00:26:00.000
This is my favorite time of night, when I relax, sleep.

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:03.910
snuggle down and go to sleep.

00:26:03.910 --> 00:26:11.130
But not until I say goodnight, sweet dreams, and I'll see you next time.

